OL,3,AUK should only rejoin EU if it         
OL,4,Ainnovates on technology, Blair warns   
OL,6,FFormer prime minister Sir Tony Blair   
OL,7,Fhas said Britain should only rejoin the
OL,8,FEuropean Union if it reforms - and     
OL,9,Fallows more innovation on technology.  
OL,11,FSpeaking to The Sunday Times, Sir Tony 
OL,12,Fsaid: "I was painted as saying Britain 
OL,13,Fshould just go back and rejoin - I'm   
OL,14,Fnot saying that - it's heavily         
OL,15,Fconditioned."                          
OL,17,FSir Tony was a prominent opponent of   
OL,18,Fleaving the EU, and told the paper: "I 
OL,19,Fdo think Brexit was a real mistake."   
OL,21,FBut he added the debate was different  
OL,22,Fnow than it was in 2016.               
